>>> 'tol' argument instead of being passed on to density() via arguments
>>> '...'.  This was easily corrected by changing the order of 'tol' and
>>> '...' from:
>>>
>>> findPeaksAndValleys.numeric <- function(x, tol=0, ..., na.rm=TRUE)
>>>
>>> to
>>>
>>> findPeaksAndValleys.numeric <- function(x, ..., tol=0, na.rm=TRUE)
>>>
