Thanks for reporting this.  I'll fix it asap.  In the meanwhile, here
is an ad hoc patch:

appendT <- function(cs1, cs2, ...) {
  files <- append(as.list(cs1), as.list(cs2));
  newInstance(cs1, files);
}

Then

csR <- appendT(csCancer, csNormals);

should work.

/Henrik

